    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter a dream where desire takes form, and nothing is ever what it seems.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fugue of Delights</i> is an erotic, daemonic visual novel crafted as a ritual of art and narrative. You will not click through choices. You will traverse layers of myth, longing, and veiled memories \u2014 guided by Elylah, the princess of erotic dreams, in search of a muse long lost to the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a story about conquest. It's about surrender.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game unfolds like a poem stitched in shadows: scenes of sensuality and revelation, loss and beauty, punishment and liberation. Explicit, symbolic, and hauntingly intimate, <i>Fugue of Delights</i> blurs the line between the player and the dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No maps. No inventory. Just feeling. Just rhythm. Just the veil, lifting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handmade traditional art</strong>: illustrations are created on paper using pencil, ink, and brush, then digitized with care.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack</strong> blending noir, ritualistic ambience, and dreamlike textures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nonlinear narrative</strong>: the story unfolds across different paths, with choices leading to secrets, d\u00e9j\u00e0 vus, and false endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbolic erotic puzzles</strong> (\u201cEnygmas\u201d): progress sometimes depends on intuitive, poetic logic rather than traditional mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nearby checkpoints</strong>: no tedious repetition. Your journey respects your time and your intuition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements</strong>: track your exploration, secrets uncovered, and erotic revelations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple, intuitive interface</strong>: minimal, immersive, and focused on the atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Female protagonist</strong> with sensual agency and mythic depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cast of daemons, muses, and goddesses</strong> across a decadent dream realm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No censorship. No apologies.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every scene is unique</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike previous titles in the <i>Delights</i> series, <i>Fugue of Delights</i> features only original and exclusive artwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each moment was given its own illustration, created specifically for it \u2014 no repetition, no reuse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you see here exists only once.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter a dream where desire takes form, and nothing is ever what it seems.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fugue of Delights</i> is an erotic, daemonic visual novel crafted as a ritual of art and narrative. You will not click through choices. You will traverse layers of myth, longing, and veiled memories \u2014 guided by Elylah, the princess of erotic dreams, in search of a muse long lost to the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a story about conquest. It's about surrender.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game unfolds like a poem stitched in shadows: scenes of sensuality and revelation, loss and beauty, punishment and liberation. Explicit, symbolic, and hauntingly intimate, <i>Fugue of Delights</i> blurs the line between the player and the dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No maps. No inventory. Just feeling. Just rhythm. Just the veil, lifting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handmade traditional art</strong>: illustrations are created on paper using pencil, ink, and brush, then digitized with care.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack</strong> blending noir, ritualistic ambience, and dreamlike textures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nonlinear narrative</strong>: the story unfolds across different paths, with choices leading to secrets, d\u00e9j\u00e0 vus, and false endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbolic erotic puzzles</strong> (\u201cEnygmas\u201d): progress sometimes depends on intuitive, poetic logic rather than traditional mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nearby checkpoints</strong>: no tedious repetition. Your journey respects your time and your intuition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements</strong>: track your exploration, secrets uncovered, and erotic revelations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple, intuitive interface</strong>: minimal, immersive, and focused on the atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Female protagonist</strong> with sensual agency and mythic depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cast of daemons, muses, and goddesses</strong> across a decadent dream realm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No censorship. No apologies.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every scene is unique</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike previous titles in the <i>Delights</i> series, <i>Fugue of Delights</i> features only original and exclusive artwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each moment was given its own illustration, created specifically for it \u2014 no repetition, no reuse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you see here exists only once.</p>",
